le":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1012518102:0":{"text":"このままでは、バドーゾ山脈どころか、周辺地域にまで影響が及んでしまう……","source_cn":"再这样下去，不止瓦度索山脉，周边地区也会受到影响。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x579E57FF138CCAF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012518103:0":{"text":"いまはそれを心配しても仕方ない。蛍光花を退治して、村人たちを守るのが先決だ。","source_cn":"担心这些也没用，先将荧荧花驱逐出去，保护村民吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE114A6E9D41B48C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"エルロン","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"ブライアン","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"kr":{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10125181","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10125181","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1012518101:0":{"text":"이쪽의 생물까지 전부 폭주하고 있어. 부패가 너무 빨리 퍼지는 바람에...","source_cn":"连这边的生物都在发狂，腐化蔓延得太快了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BA7FD7EAA56B95A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1012518102:0":{"text":"이러다간 바투소 산맥뿐 아니라 주변 지역도 영향을 받을 수 있어.","source_cn":"再这样下去，不止瓦度索山脉，周边地区也会受到影响。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x579E57FF138CCAF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"